 report\n\n## Decision\n\nAutomatic promotion is not justified. No canonical-write issue is recommended from this evidence. The classifier performs no canonical, remote, production, or public writes and makes no VLM calls.\n\n## Review hardening\n\n- fail closed on drift from all five exact committed #1621 source hashes\n- expand nested mark-owner hierarchies before structural comparison\n- detect warning-only provider retry exhaustion\n- emit stable JSON diagnostics on CLI failure\n- prove truth changes affect measurements but never row dispositions\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1621_unseen_batch.test.py` (11 passed)\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1622_promotion_classifier.test.py` (17 passed)\n- `npm run quality:report-index` (pass)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (healthy task branch; expected dirty/untracked task files before commit)\n- deterministic artifact regeneration SHA-256: `e0c188de88c61a0d9eeddc5a233572e237d2c76b7a9d935420af12a5356bce72`\n- `git diff --exit-code HEAD -- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/image-first-vlm-1621` (unchanged)\n\nCloses #1622","created_at":"2026-07-19T18:21:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T18:43:08Z","closed_at":"2026-07-19T18:43:08Z","merged_at":"2026-07-19T18:43:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"fd6b6cac7cf0ac20b6f8305ecb34eae0bf0cf942","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1626/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1626/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1626/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/56a6bcac4483f9e5e29c4cae812c002a13eb9045","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1622-local-vlm-canonic